/ kind-is-type: a kind is a type under its parent (kind<T> : kind : type), names are unique at their own level, and a format type owns its bytes.
/ This goal is the plan's index and its proof: each stage is a goal, each comment a behaviour we want,
/ and the step under it runs the test that proves it. Tests live under this plan's folder at the path of
/ what they test. The plang here is intent: the test-designer writes each test so it builds and goes red
/ before its stage, the coder makes it green. The text is start.md; checks tests can't show are there too.
Start
- call Stage0
- call Stage1
- call Stage2
- call Stage3
- call Stage4
- call Stage5

Stage0
/ a goal's path is where its .pr is found (landed with the coder's own pins, decision 745)
/ a goal moved with its .build folder runs at its new path
- call /plan/kind-is-type/goal/MovedGoalRunsWhereItIs
/ an app's .pr whose old "path" says /system/ gets no os trust: its real folder is the app's
- call /plan/kind-is-type/goal/AppGoalNeverPassesAsSystem
/ an old .pr with "path" and "prPath" reads as it did
- call /plan/kind-is-type/goal/OldPrReadsAsBefore

Stage1
/ the probe: number's kinds are kind<number>; a kind answers what is its own and asks number for the rest
/ "set %n% = 1.5 as decimal" keeps decimal: %n!type.name% is number, %n!type.kind.name% is decimal
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/number/DecimalIsANumber

Stage2
/ settings are settings: each settings class is a type of its own (no backward compat for old rows — decision 790)
/ no type is renamed: "as text" and "as list" find the types they always did (a guard)
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/ShortNameFindsTheType
/ the llm settings class is a type of its own, named by its namespace
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/SettingClassIsAType

Stage3
/ every family's kinds are types under their parent, found only through it
/ a json value is item's, not text's (decision 773): %x!type.name% is item, %x% is text is false, kind is json
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/item/JsonIsItemsKind
/ a list of path knows its element: [0] is born a path
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/list/ListKnowsItsElement
/ a kind nests: a list of lists of path — C# test at PLang.Tests/Types/App/Types/KindNestsTests.cs
/ two types can each have a kind with the same name: each is found through its own parent
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/kind/SameKindNameUnderTwoTypes
/ a separator is a kind of text with five named values; any characters are allowed too
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/separator/NamedValuesBelongToTheType
/ a strict kind is checked: an image that isn't a gif is refused as a gif — the stage adopts
/ the four existing kind/strict tests as its proof (SetAsImageGifStrictMismatch and siblings)
- call /app/type/kind/strict/SetAsImageGifStrictMismatch

Stage4
/ a format type owns its work: its bytes stay raw until first use, then it parses itself
/ a json file read and written on unchanged is byte-for-byte the same
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/json/PassedOnUnread
/ the first read into a json file parses it into a plang dict: "%cfg% is dict" is true
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/json/ReadIntoIsADict
/ a json array parses into a plang list
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/json/ArrayIsAList
/ a csv file the same way, through its own type (a guard)
- call /plan/kind-is-type/app/type/csv/ReadIntoIsATable
/ a dict slot given an unread json value reads through json — C# test at PLang.Tests/Runtime/App/Goals/TypedSlotJsonReadTests.cs

Stage5
/ the builder offers each type with its kinds under it, and a generic asks for its element
/ each of the baseline's five sentences builds what it says (the builder measures 5/5)
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/variable/set/AsDecimalKeepsDecimal
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/variable/set/AsListOfPathKeepsTheElement
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/variable/set/AsJsonKeepsJson
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/file/read/AsTextKeepsText
/ the read itself lands that type, uncaptured — no write-to variable.set to convert a file reference (831)
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/file/read/AsTextLandsTextUncaptured
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/variable/set/AsIsoDurationKeepsIso
/ the guards don't move: no "as", no type; "as text" stays text
- call /plan/kind-is-type/module/variable/set/NoAsNoType
